# Thathvamasi Production Routing & Reverse Proxy Rules
# Compatible with Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, etc.

# Admin portal routing (ensures domain.com/admin serves admin portal)
/admin      /admin/index.html   200
/admin/     /admin/index.html   200

# API Reverse Proxy (can be redirected to live backend)
/api/*  https://api.tbspltd.com/api/:splat  200

# 404 Fallback
/*      /404.html                               404
